  "title": "Clay Model v0 Embeddings",
  "description": "Semantic embeddings generated by the Clay Foundation Model v0 for all Earth Observation imagery used in its training corpus. Each record pairs a dense float vector embedding with a geographic geometry and acquisition date, covering global satellite tiles. Clay is a Vision Transformer trained via Self-Supervised Learning (Masked Autoencoder) on geospatial and temporal EO data.",
